    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Did the narrater find his mother's grave?",
      "translation": "那个男人真的在某个地方见过那个女人吗？",
      "startTime": 9.57,
      "endTime": 13.97,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I stopped to let the car cool off and to study the map.",
      "translation": "我停下来去买份报纸。",
      "startTime": 13.98,
      "endTime": 18.27,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Car",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "轿车"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I had expected to be near my objective by now, but everything still seemed alien to me.",
      "translation": "我应该说我已经停下来去买报纸了，因为直到我付钱给那个女人时，我才意识到自己从未去过那里。",
      "startTime": 18.28,
      "endTime": 25.72,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I was only five when my father had taken me abroad, and that was eighteen years ago.",
      "translation": "报刊亭里的那个女人是个老太太，面容和蔼。",
      "startTime": 25.73,
      "endTime": 32.34,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Five",
            "pos": "num.",
            "meaning": "五"
          },
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          },
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "When my mother had died after a tragic accident, he did not quickly recover from the shock and loneliness.",
      "translation": "她的眼睛有些不对劲，但我不知道是什么。",
      "startTime": 32.35,
      "endTime": 40.36,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Everything around him was full of her presence, continually reopening the wound.",
      "translation": "不知为什么，这让我感到不安。",
      "startTime": 40.37,
      "endTime": 46.01,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "disturbed",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "使不安"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "So he decided to emigrate.",
      "translation": "这让我想起了一些事情，但我不知道是什么。",
      "startTime": 46.02,
      "endTime": 48.4,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "reminded",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "提醒"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "In the new country he became absorbed in making a new life for the two of us, so that he gradually ceased to grieve.",
      "translation": "'你的零钱，'她说。",
      "startTime": 48.41,
      "endTime": 57.03,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "He did not marry again and I was brought up without a woman's care; but I lacked for nothing, for he was both father and mother to me.",
      "translation": "'这不对，'我说。",
      "startTime": 57.04,
      "endTime": 66.89,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          },
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "He always meant to go back one day, but not to stay.",
      "translation": "'我给了你一张十英镑的钞票，而你只找了我两英镑。'",
      "startTime": 66.9,
      "endTime": 70.64,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "His roots and mine had become too firmly embedded in the new land.",
      "translation": "那个女人的脸红了。",
      "startTime": 70.65,
      "endTime": 75.53,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Too",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "也"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "But he wanted to see the old folk againand to visit my mother's grave.",
      "translation": "'哦，我很抱歉，'她说。",
      "startTime": 75.54,
      "endTime": 80.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Old",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "老的，旧的"
          },
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "He became mortally ill a few months before we had planned to go and, when he knew that he was dying, he made me promise to go on my own.",
      "translation": "'我是把你当成另一个人了。'",
      "startTime": 80.32,
      "endTime": 91.43,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          },
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          },
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I hired a car the day after landing and bought a comprehensive book of maps,",
      "translation": "'我的视力不像以前那么好了。'",
      "startTime": 91.44,
      "endTime": 96.92,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Car",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "轿车"
          },
          {
