            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          },
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "so that I was positive I should recognize it as familiar territory.",
      "translation": "'我在那儿住过几年。'",
      "startTime": 117.66,
      "endTime": 122.92,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          },
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Well, I had been wrong, for I was now lost.",
      "translation": "'你是弗林特太太吗？'",
      "startTime": 122.93,
      "endTime": 127.73,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Well",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "健康的，良好的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I looked at the map and then at the milometer.",
      "translation": "'是的，'她说。",
      "startTime": 127.74,
      "endTime": 131.32,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I had come ten miles since leaving the town and at this point, according to my father,",
      "translation": "'我以前经常在你这儿买报纸。'",
      "startTime": 131.33,
      "endTime": 138.38,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          },
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          },
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I should be looking at farms and cottages in a valley,",
      "translation": "'我就知道我以前见过你，'她说。",
      "startTime": 138.39,
      "endTime": 142.47,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "with the spire of the church of our village showing in the far distance.",
      "translation": "'你以前常骑着一辆大红色的自行车送报纸。'",
      "startTime": 142.48,
      "endTime": 147.62,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "deliver",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "投递"
          },
          {
            "word": "bicycle",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "自行车"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I could see no valley, no farms, no cottages and no church spire-only a lake.",
      "translation": "'那一定是二十年前的事了，'我说。",
      "startTime": 147.63,
      "endTime": 154.87,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "twenty",
            "pos": "num.",
            "meaning": "二十"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I decided that I must have taken a wrong turning somewhere.",
      "translation": "'我也许看起来老了点儿，但还没那么老！'",
      "startTime": 154.88,
      "endTime": 159.18,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "So I drove back to the town and began to retrace the route, taking frequent glances at the map.",
      "translation": "那个女人笑了。",
      "startTime": 159.19,
      "endTime": 166.43,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I landed up at the same corner.",
      "translation": "'对不起，'她说。",
      "startTime": 166.44,
      "endTime": 169.17,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The curious thing was that the lake was not marked on the map.",
      "translation": "'我会记得那是因为我把我的眼镜打碎了。'",
      "startTime": 169.18,
      "endTime": 173.26,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          },
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I felt as if I had stumbled into a nightmare country, as you sometimes do in dreams.",
      "translation": "'我无法分辨谁是谁。'",
      "startTime": 173.27,
      "endTime": 179.54,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "You",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "你，你们"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s28",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "And, as in a nightmare, there was nobody in sight to help me.",
      "translation": "'我希望你现在还能打碎眼镜，'我说。",
      "startTime": 179.55,
      "endTime": 184.42,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s29",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Fortunately for me, as I was wondering what to do next,",
      "translation": "'你那时总是给我太多零钱！'",
      "startTime": 184.43,
      "endTime": 188.51,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          },
          {
            "word": "What",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s30",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "there appeared on the horizon a man on horseback, riding in my direction.",
      "translation": "地平线上出现了一个骑马的人，朝我的方向骑来。",
      "startTime": 188.52,
      "endTime": 194,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Man",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "男人"
          },
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s31",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I waited till he came near, then I asked him the way to our old village.",
      "translation": "我等他走近，然后问他去我们旧村子的路。",
      "startTime": 194.01,
      "endTime": 199.44,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Old",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "老的，旧的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s32",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "He said that there was now no village.",
      "translation": "他说现在没有村子了。",
      "startTime": 199.45,
      "endTime": 202.5,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s33",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I thought he must have misunderstood me, so I repeated its name.",
      "translation": "我想他一定误解了我的意思，于是我又重复了一遍村名。",
      "startTime": 202.51,
      "endTime": 208.07,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          },
          {
            "word": "Name",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "名字"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s34",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "This time he pointed to the lake.",
      "translation": "这次他指向了湖。",
      "startTime": 208.08,
      "endTime": 211.14,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s35",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The village no longer existed because it had been submerged, and all the valley too.",
      "translation": "村子已经不存在了，因为它已被淹没，整个山谷也是如此。",
      "startTime": 211.15,
      "endTime": 218.48,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
